member.summary:
Handles one locked work item, only after the LOCKED confirmation (A-1).
Return variables → complete;  → bpmn-error;
 → outcome-unknown;  → fail;
 after a cancel request → cancel-ack (otherwise unlock);
any other exception → fail with retries, or outcome-unknown when the subscription is irreversible (VI.3.2 rule 5).
Downstream calls should send  as their idempotency key (R36).
